    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option A (\"A societal shift valuing liberated personal time over material consumerism\")\n\n• Acoustic & Textual Evidence:\nThe audio recording explicitly states: \"Host: Dr. Vasseur, in closing, is this a fleeting management fad or the harbinger of a new civilizational contract? Dr. Vasseur: It is an inevitable historical mutation. In the twentieth century, we transitioned from six to five days powered by mechanization gains. Today, with artificial intelligence and ecological limits, our most precious asset is no longer material hoarding, but disposable time for caretaking, civic engagement, and self-actualization.\".\nChoice A faithfully reflects the essential factual information confirmed in the recording.\n\n• Detailed Distractor Breakdown (Incorrect Options):\n  - Option A (\"A societal shift valuing liberated personal time over material consumerism\") [CORRECT]: Accurately aligns with the verified facts and spoken keywords in the audio document.\n  - Option B (\"An inevitable reversion to six-day workweeks driven by international cost pressures\") [INCORRECT - UNSUBSTANTIATED EXTRAPOLATION]: Erroneous proposition; introduces elements contradicting the audio document (\"An inevitable reversion to six-day workweeks driven by international cost pressures\").\n  - Option C (\"The complete eclipse of wage employment in favor of precarious gig economy labor\") [INCORRECT - FAULTY CAUSALITY DISTRACTOR]: Erroneous proposition; introduces elements contradicting the audio document (\"The complete eclipse of wage employment in favor of precarious gig economy labor\").\n  - Option D (\"The irreversible plateauing of productivity gains stymied by technical bottlenecks\") [INCORRECT - VERBATIM LEXICAL TRAP]: Erroneous proposition; introduces elements contradicting the audio document (\"The irreversible plateauing of productivity gains stymied by technical bottlenecks\")."
